*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% 43 A + 43 Leitz-prefixed B media aliases (86 profiles). Source-specific geometry preserved; hardware verification incomplete.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.5.0"
*% Development driver branch; this PPD file version is not a release number.
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "LEITZICO.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Leitz"
*Product: "(Leitz Icon)"
*ModelName: "Leitz Icon USB"
*ShortNickName: "Leitz Icon USB"
*NickName: "Leitz Icon - 86 Media Profiles (experimental)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*DeviceID: "Icon"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Leitz;MDL:Icon"
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsIPPReason com.leitz.out-of-paper-error/Out of labels.: ""
*cupsIPPReason com.leitz.read-error/Cannot read data from printer.: ""
*cupsIPPReason com.leitz.ready/Printer is ready.: ""
*cupsIPPReason com.leitz.general-error/General print error.: ""
*cupsIPPReason com.leitz.head-overheat-error/Print head overheated.: ""
*cupsIPPReason com.leitz.slot-status-error/Label path is blocked.: ""
*cupsIPPReason com.leitz.busy-error/The printer is currently in use.: ""
*cupsIPPReason com.leitz.paper-size-error/Label being printed does not match label width currently in printer.: ""
*cupsIPPReason com.leitz.paper-size-undefine-error/Insert a label cassette in the printer.: ""
*cupsIPPReason com.leitz.door-open-error/The door is open.: ""
*cupsIPPReason com.leitz.no-cartridge-error/No cartridge.: ""
*cupsIPPReason com.leitz.incompatible-cartridge-error/Incompatible cartridge.: ""
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 leitz-rastertoicon"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-command 0 leitz-command"
*cupsCommands: "ReportStatus"
*% The printer has no verified hardware copy-generation command.
*% The upstream CUPS RIP must produce complete raster pages for each copy.
*cupsManualCopies: True
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: StandardAddressLabel
@LEITZ_PAGE_SIZE@
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: StandardAddressLabel
@LEITZ_PAGE_REGION@
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: StandardAddressLabel
@LEITZ_IMAGEABLE_AREA@
*DefaultPaperDimension: StandardAddressLabel
@LEITZ_PAPER_DIMENSION@
*HWMargins: 3.600 3.600 3.600 3.600
*VariablePaperSize: True
*MaxMediaWidth: "258.000"
*MaxMediaHeight: "7680.000"
*MinMediaWidth: "26.000"
*MinMediaHeight: "14.000"
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 26.000 258.000
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 14.000 7680.000
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 3
*OpenUI *LabelCutter/Cut Between Labels: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 13 AnySetup *LabelCutter
*DefaultLabelCutter: OFF
*LabelCutter ON/Cut Each Label: ""
*LabelCutter OFF/Cut At Job End (experimental): ""
*CloseUI: *LabelCutter
*OpenUI *LeitzProtocol/Print Protocol (development): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 12 AnySetup *LeitzProtocol
*DefaultLeitzProtocol: Auto
*LeitzProtocol Auto/Automatic (Current, then Native): ""
*LeitzProtocol Current/Current: ""
*LeitzProtocol Native/Native: ""
*CloseUI: *LeitzProtocol
*OpenUI *LeitzCutMode/Cut Length: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 11 AnySetup *LeitzCutMode
*DefaultLeitzCutMode: Automatic
*LeitzCutMode Automatic/Automatic cut: ""
*LeitzCutMode Content/Force cut after last ink (roll only, experimental): ""
*LeitzCutMode Page/Cut at selected page length (use a custom size for continuous rolls): ""
*CloseUI: *LeitzCutMode
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300x300dpi
*Resolution 300x600dpi/300 x 600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 600]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 300x300dpi/300 x 300 dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Black
*ColorModel Black/Black and White: "<</cupsColorSpace 3 /cupsBitsPerColor 1 /cupsBitsPerPixel 1>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray8/8-bit Grayscale (driver dither): "<</cupsColorSpace 3 /cupsBitsPerColor 8 /cupsBitsPerPixel 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel
*OpenUI *LeitzDither/Grayscale Rendering: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 21 AnySetup *LeitzDither
*DefaultLeitzDither: Bayer4
*LeitzDither Bayer4/Ordered 4x4 Bayer: ""
*LeitzDither Threshold/Black/White Threshold: ""
*CloseUI: *LeitzDither
*OpenUI *DebugMode/Leitz Debug: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 23 AnySetup *DebugMode
*DefaultDebugMode: Release
*DebugMode Release/Debug Off: ""
*DebugMode Debug/Debug On: ""
*DebugMode Mesh/Add Bounds and Center Cross (diagnostic): ""
*CloseUI: *DebugMode
*OpenUI *LeitzCurrentRaster/Current Raster Encoding: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 22 AnySetup *LeitzCurrentRaster
*DefaultLeitzCurrentRaster: Optimized
*LeitzCurrentRaster Optimized/Optimized (existing Current output): ""
*LeitzCurrentRaster FullWidthRaw/Full-width raw rows (experimental, Current only): ""
*LeitzCurrentRaster TrimmedRaw/Trimmed raw rows (experimental, Current only): ""
*LeitzCurrentRaster NoSkipRaw/Full-width raw including blank rows (vendor level 0, experimental): ""
*CloseUI: *LeitzCurrentRaster
*OpenUI *CutMedia/Cut Media: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 14 AnySetup *CutMedia
*DefaultCutMedia: False
*CutMedia False/False: "<</CutMedia 0>>setpagedevice"
*CutMedia True/True: "<</CutMedia 4>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *CutMedia
*OpenUI *ContinuousMedia/Continuous Media: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *ContinuousMedia
*DefaultContinuousMedia: OFF
*ContinuousMedia ON/Continuous Media On: ""
*ContinuousMedia OFF/Continuous Media Off: ""
*CloseUI: *ContinuousMedia
*OpenUI *PrintThroughPRN/Send through .prn File: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 16 AnySetup *PrintThroughPRN
*DefaultPrintThroughPRN: OFF
*PrintThroughPRN ON/Send through .prn File: ""
*PrintThroughPRN OFF/Do not Send through .prn File: ""
