*OpenUI *OptimizationLevel/Optimization Level: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 24 AnySetup *OptimizationLevel
*DefaultOptimizationLevel: 2
*OptimizationLevel 0/0: ""
*OptimizationLevel 1/1: ""
*OptimizationLevel 2/2: ""
*OptimizationLevel 3/3: ""
