*OpenUI *PrintQuality/PrintQuality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 35 AnySetup *PrintQuality
*DefaultPrintQuality: Bayer8x8
*PrintQuality Draft/Draft: "<</cupsColorSpace 3 /cupsBitsPerColor 1 /cupsBitsPerPixel 1>>setpagedevice"
*PrintQuality SuperCell/SuperCell: "<</cupsColorSpace 3 /cupsBitsPerColor 8 /cupsBitsPerPixel 8>>setpagedevice"
*PrintQuality Bayer4x4/Bayer4x4: "<</cupsColorSpace 3 /cupsBitsPerColor 8 /cupsBitsPerPixel 8>>setpagedevice"
*PrintQuality Bayer8x8/Bayer8x8: "<</cupsColorSpace 3 /cupsBitsPerColor 8 /cupsBitsPerPixel 8>>setpagedevice"
