*PrintQuality Dithering3x3/Dithering3x3: "<</cupsColorSpace 3 /cupsBitsPerColor 8 /cupsBitsPerPixel 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PrintQuality
*OpenUI *Halftone/Halftone (Windows): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 26 AnySetup *Halftone
